# PROVENANCE — infinity6c

SigmaStar Alkaid SDK for Infinity6C (vendor CHIP = i6c), the SSC377 line.
Prebuilt userspace MI libraries. Nothing here is built from source.

Two drops are carried. `1230` is what `soc/sigmastar/infinity6c.mk` selects;
`0907` is kept because it is the better-provenanced of the two and is the only
one with a glibc variant.

    lib/0907/glibc/11.1.0/     47 libraries, 4 licence files
    lib/0907/uclibc/9.1.0/     48 libraries, 4 licence files
    lib/1230/uclibc/9.1.0/     51 libraries, 4 licence files

A drop directory is named by the vendor's own release date in MMDD, which is
the vendor's convention. The two here are two years apart -- 0907 is 2022-09-07
and 1230 is 2024-12-30 -- so read the year out of this file rather than the
directory name.

The kernel half of each drop is johnchia/sigmastar-sdk under the same family
and the same drop name. They must move together: see that repository's
infinity6c/PROVENANCE.

